// Two users' map streams under a policy that lets each reach only its own nodes: nodes the observer may not see go down, come up, rename, join, are deleted and log out (ephemeral), then a one-way rule from the observer's user shows them and is taken back. TS_DEBUG_MAP logs a stream's first keepalive only, so repeated keepalives are not in the frames.
